      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " The universality of the gunas: no one — not the gods themselves — stands outside the three. Osho would say: this is the great leveling. The saint and the sinner, the god and the demon, all breathe the same three winds; the difference is not which winds blow but how the man stands in them. Heaven and earth are the same school. This verse destroys spiritual snobbery: you cannot buy a guna-free existence, and nobody can sell you one. What you can do is know the gunas as the weather of nature — and find the witness that is prior to the weather. The witness is the only thing not in the list."]
