      children: [(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.strong, {
        children: "Osho Darshan:"
      }), " Sanjaya confesses the miracle of his hearing: through the grace of Vyasa, he heard the secret yoga directly from Krishna as it was being spoken. Osho would say: the Gita is not history; it is an eternal present — every reader is the Sanjaya, every reading is the sakshat, the direct hearing. The grace of Vyasa is the grace of the transmitter: the one who composes the scripture in such a way that the reader is no longer reading about the dialogue but standing inside it. When the scripture says \"this is a secret,\" the door opens — not to a fact but to a presence. The hearing is direct because the heart is the receiver."]
